.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-REFRESH-COMPOSE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-refresh-compose
.Nd refresh compose.yaml from the bundle
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad refresh-compose
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad refresh-compose
fetches the latest
.Pa compose.yaml
for the bundled install and replaces the local copy if it differs.
When run from a checked-out git repository the local file is used as-is and
nothing is fetched.
.Pp
Refreshing the file does not restart anything on its own.
Run
.Xr nomad-down 1
then
.Xr nomad-up 1
to apply the refreshed definition to the running stack.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad refresh-compose
Refresh the local compose.yaml from the bundle.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-down 1 ,
.Xr nomad-up 1
